                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Divide the rainy-day train branch probability by the total probability of taking the train.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "From part (a), $P(A\\cap B)=0.36$ and $P(A)=0.54$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(B\\mid A)&=\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(A)}\\\\P(B\\mid A)&=\\frac{0.36}{0.54}\\\\P(B\\mid A)&=\\frac{2}{3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
